{
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed removal of the previously secured Condition 8 of Planning Permission P/2021/4479 would allow additional vehicular traffic movements and demand for highly limited public highway car parking capacity within Strand on the Green Controlled Parking Zone in the context of its high existing parking stress level and the submitted parking survey's technical errors and inaccurate use of the Lambeth Council methodology (which does not provide adequate evidence to justify Condition 8's removal) which in turn would have a detrimental effect to existing and future residents contrary to London Plan Policies T4, T6 and Local Plan Policy EC2.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal would result in harmful loss of public highway parking availability for existing resident parking permit holders, harm the efficient and sustainable management of the constrained local highway network and not achieve car free residential development in an area with good public transport accessibility, fail to promote sustainable forms of transport contrary to London Plan Policies T4, T6 and Local Plan Policy EC2.  "
  ],
